        <h1 class="hero__title"><span>Ipsos Issues Index: April 2020</span>
</h1>

                  <div class="hero__description">In the first telephone-based Issues Index, Covid-19 tops the list of Britons’ biggest issues with an historically high score</div>
        
        
                  <div class="hero__date">
            <time datetime="21.04.20">21.04.20</time>
          </div>
        
                  <div class="hero__share block-toolbar with-download-link">
            <span class="hero__share-title">Share</span>
            <ul class="block-social-sharing">
                              <li>
                  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.ipsos.com/en-uk/ipsos-issues-index-april-2020"
                     class="icon icon--facebook-filled" data-name="facebook" target="_blank">
